<h1 data-copy-en="Swish" data-copy-zh="Swish">Swish</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Basketball Court events, drills, perception reward and the narrow date window." data-copy-zh="篮球场事件、训练、感知奖励与约会实际时段。">Basketball Court events, drills, perception reward and the narrow date window.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">在哪里找到</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系节点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">常见卡点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Boardwalk_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Open_Look"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Court_Read"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Heart-to-Heart_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Progression_and_Automatic_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats_and_Availability"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Swish — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/swish.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Swish — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/swish.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Swish — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Swish’s Basketball Court route has drills, two H2Hs, one date and a one-time Perception reward. The drills increase affection; they do not directly raise player stats.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Present → Uptown Community Center → Hallway → Basketball Court. The two interior travel steps cost 0 minutes. Swish appears daily 10:00–18:00.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Place</th><th scope="col">Portrait hours</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Basketball Court</th><td data-label="Portrait hours">10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Condition">—</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Follow the five Court events: first drill, Shot Chart at Known (25), Five Players at Friend (100), Empty Court at Close Friend (200), then Last Possession at Crush (400). Court Read needs Shot Chart and Known. Open Look needs Crush and Court Read, at 16:00–18:00; it does not additionally require Last Possession or the date.</p><p>Court Vision needs Friend (100), Ability 35 and at least 12 Energy available. It takes 45 minutes and gives Perception +1 and 8 direct affection once; those 12 Energy are checked but not spent. The Boardwalk date needs Close Friend (200) and Diane’s construction, with an effective start of only 17:00–18:00.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: personal and shared event navigation</summary><p>Each listed event happens once. Return to the named place after completing its prior steps. Completion affection is a base reward; dialogue choices can add further affection. The scenes and choice answers remain in the game.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base completion affection</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">First Drill</th><td data-label="Requirements">Basketball Court; 10:00–18:00; Swish Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Swish +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Shot Chart</th><td data-label="Requirements">Basketball Court; 10:00–18:00; Swish Known (25); First Drill</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Swish +6</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Five Players</th><td data-label="Requirements">Basketball Court; 10:00–18:00; Swish Friend (100); The Shot Chart</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Swish +7</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Empty Court</th><td data-label="Requirements">Basketball Court; 10:00–18:00; Swish Close Friend (200); Five Players</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Swish +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Last Possession</th><td data-label="Requirements">Basketball Court; 10:00–18:00; Swish Crush (400); Empty Court</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Swish +8</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Ordinary_Actions"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / usable start time</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / normal limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Swish</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Basketball Court; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+1 base affection; 4/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Run Drills</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Basketball Court; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">45 min; −20 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+5 base affection; 2/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Court Read</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Basketball Court; Known (25); The Shot Chart</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −15 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">dialogue-choice affection; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Court Vision</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Basketball Court; Friend (100); Ability 35</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">45 min; 12 Energy available, not spent</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+8 direct affection; Perception +1; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Boardwalk Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Basketball Court; Close Friend (200); Diane’s Boardwalk built; 17:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $80; −35 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once; +8 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Open Look</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Basketball Court; Crush (400); Court Read; 16:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −15 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">dialogue-choice affection; once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Run Drills costs 45 minutes and 20 Energy, gives 5 base affection and has two positive uses daily. Talk takes 20 minutes, gives 1 base affection and has four positive uses. The separate Court Coach job has proficiency and Stamina requirements and does not award Swish affection.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: affection bonuses</summary><p>Each favorite-stat threshold adds 1 before ordinary affection bonuses; the favorite skill doubles the adjusted base. Direct rewards remain the listed direct amount. An affinity is not itself a lesson offered by this character.</p><p>Ability 40; Stamina 45; Perception 40</p><p>Favorite skill: Tactical Awareness</p></details><p>Start windows exclude their ending hour. Costs are base values; applicable skills and active bonuses may change them. Base affection, direct affection, player experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate. Conversation choices can add rewards beyond event-completion affection.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting_and_Current_Content"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><p>The date’s displayed later end does not keep Swish at the Court after 18:00. For Court Vision, restore Energy to 12 even though it is not charged. Run Drills and the Coach job are separate actions with different rewards.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships and affection</a></li><li><a href="skills.html">Skills</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">Locations</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-specialist-class.html">Proficiencies and work</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Boardwalk_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Open_Look"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Court_Read"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Heart-to-Heart_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Progression_and_Automatic_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats_and_Availability"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Swish 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/swish.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Swish 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/swish.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Swish 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Swish 的篮球场路线包含训练、两段谈心、一次约会及一次性感知奖励。训练增加好感度，不会直接增加玩家属性。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>在哪里找到</h2><p>路线为现代 → 上城区社区中心 → 走廊 → 篮球场，两段内部移动均耗时 0 分钟。Swish 每天 10:00–18:00 出现。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">肖像在场时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">篮球场</th><td data-label="肖像在场时段">10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">—</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系节点</h2><p>依次推进五项球场事件：首次训练、已知（25）的投篮图、朋友（100）的五人节点、亲密朋友（200）的空球场，以及迷恋（400）的最后一球。球场解读要求投篮图与已知；空位机会要求迷恋及球场解读完成，并在 16:00–18:00 进行，不额外要求先完成最后一球或约会。</p><p>球场视野要求朋友（100）、能力 35，且当前至少有 12 精力。耗时 45 分钟，一次性给予感知 +1 与 8 直接好感度；12 精力只检查是否足够，不扣除。木板路约会要求亲密朋友（200）与 Diane 已完成建设，实际只能在 17:00–18:00 开始。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：个人与共同事件的触发条件</summary><p>下列事件均为一次性内容。完成前置后，请返回对应地点。完成好感度列为基础奖励，对话选择还可能追加好感度。剧情与选项答案请在游戏中体验。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">完成基础好感度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">第一次训练</th><td data-label="条件">篮球场; 10:00–18:00; Swish 陌生人 (0)</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Swish +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">投篮分布图</th><td data-label="条件">篮球场; 10:00–18:00; Swish 已知 (25); 第一次训练</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Swish +6</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">五名球员</th><td data-label="条件">篮球场; 10:00–18:00; Swish 朋友 (100); 投篮分布图</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Swish +7</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">空荡的球场</th><td data-label="条件">篮球场; 10:00–18:00; Swish 亲密朋友 (200); 五名球员</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Swish +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">最后一攻</th><td data-label="条件">篮球场; 10:00–18:00; Swish 迷恋 (400); 空荡的球场</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Swish +8</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Ordinary_Actions"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／可开始时间</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／常规次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和Swish聊聊</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">篮球场; 陌生人 (0)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">20 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+1 基础好感度; 4次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">进行训练</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">篮球场; 已知 (25)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">45 分钟; −20 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+5 基础好感度; 2次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">球场解读</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">篮球场; 已知 (25); 投篮分布图</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟; −15 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">好感度由对话选择决定；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">球场视野</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">篮球场; 朋友 (100); 能力 35</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">45 分钟；需有 12 精力，不扣除</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+8 直接好感度; 感知 +1; 一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">海滨步道约会</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">篮球场; 亲密朋友 (200); 已通过 Diane 建成木板路; 17:00–18:00</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120 分钟; $80; −35 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性; +8 事件完成基础好感度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">空位机会</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">篮球场; 迷恋 (400); 球场解读; 16:00–18:00</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟; −15 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">好感度由对话选择决定；一次性</td></tr></tbody></table><p>训练每次消耗 45 分钟与 20 精力，增加 5 基础好感度，每天有两次正面使用机会。交谈每次 20 分钟，增加 1 基础好感度，每天四次。球场独立的教练工作另有专长与耐力要求，不增加 Swish 好感度。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：好感度加成</summary><p>每达到一项偏好属性门槛，普通好感度计算的基础值增加 1；偏好技能会将调整后的基础值翻倍。直接奖励仍按标明的直接数值加入。偏好技能本身不代表该角色会教授它。</p><p>能力 40; 耐力 45; 感知 40</p><p>偏好技能：战术意识</p></details><p>开始时段不包含结束整点。消耗为基础值，适用技能与当前加成可能改变实际数值。基础好感度、直接好感度、玩家经验与 NPC 亲密经验分别计算；对话选择可能在事件完成好感度之外追加奖励。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting_and_Current_Content"></span><h2>常见卡点</h2><p>约会写出的较晚结束时间不会让 Swish 在 18:00 后继续留在球场。球场视野虽然不扣精力，仍需先恢复到 12。普通训练与教练工作是奖励不同的两项行动。</p></section>
